# The other direction, and a spell rather than a permanent: Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills Bot1's Llanowar Elves. The Elves go to
# Bot1's own graveyard (the Leyline's controller is not its own opponent), while the Bolt, resolving into Bot2's graveyard,
# is exiled instead (CR 614.1a, 608.2n). Bot1's graveyard = Llanowar Elves, Bot2's is empty, the Bolt is in exile.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of the Void
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Lightning Bolt
